# Implements [DIST-VSIX-CONTENTS]. What must NEVER reach a user's VSIX.
#
# The extension runs from the esbuild bundle (`dist/extension.js`) and the
# staged native payload (`bin/`), so TypeScript sources, the compiled test tree
# and the test fixtures are all dead weight — and the fixtures alone are tens of
# megabytes of .NET projects. `bin/` and `dist/` are deliberately NOT listed.

# Sources and build inputs — the bundle already contains everything needed.
src/**
out/**
tsconfig.json
eslint.config.mjs
esbuild.mjs
clean-out.mjs
.vscode-test.mjs
test-cli-runner.cjs
test-chunks.json
test-fixtures/**
coverage/**
.vscode-test/**

# Source maps: a dev-bundle artefact, not something a user needs.
**/*.map

# AppleDouble resource forks from macOS archives (netcoredbg ships as a .zip).
**/__MACOSX/**
**/.DS_Store
